cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: RabbitSoftware
authors:
  - family-names: Ringquist
    given-names: Chase Allen
version: 0.11.0
date-released: '2026-10-02'
license: UPL-1.0
type: software
repository-code: https://github.com/DNA-Blockchain/Helloworld
url: https://github.com/DNA-Blockchain/Helloworld
abstract: >-
  RabbitSoftware is research operating-system, AI-model and blockchain software. Local nodes gather
  public biomedical literature, record what they found on a replicated signed chain, and answer
  technical questions from those records with citations. Research records export to BibTeX, RIS, CSV
  and JSONL carrying each source's own identifier and terms, and a documented JSON provenance format
  travels with them.
keywords:
  - biomedical research
  - literature search
  - research software
  - data provenance
  - reproducible research
  - blockchain
